<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela's Lagoven ups liquid natural gas output.</title>
<headline>Venezuela's Lagoven ups liquid natural gas output.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petroleos de Venezuela (PDVSA) unit Lagoven increased its output of liquid natural gas to 49,000 barrels per day (bpd) in the first half of 1996, up 3,000 bpd from the first half of 1995, Lagoven said Thursday.</p>
<p>Lagoven said it planned to nearly double liquid natural gas output to 86,000 bpd by the end of 1998.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 834405</p>
</text>
